ent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014K6tkZfCh763YgvYhodf8r", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 381122, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YC7MYcciRQwV5JULLJRT63", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/fastjson-cve-2026-31337", "base": "main", "title": "Upgrade fastjson to 2.9.4 to fix CVE-2026-31337", "body": "## Summary\nUpgrades `fastjson` from 2.8.0 to 2.9.4 to remediate **CVE-2026-31337** (high severity): unbounded recursion when parsing deeply nested arrays.\n\n- Affected: `<2.9.4`, `>=3.0.0 <3.1.0`\n- Fixed in: `2.9.4`, `3.1.0`\n\n2.9.4 was chosen as the minimal fix within the current 2.x major line to avoid a major-version upgrade.\n\n## Changes\n- `requirements.txt`: `fastjson==2.8.0` -> `fastjson==2.9.4`\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: added security entry under Unreleased\n\n## Testing\nCI run `ci-0001` passed on commit `3a05f1e86f`.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fastjson-cve-2026-31337", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 412022, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YC7MYcciRQwV5JULLJRT63", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fastjson-cve-2026-31337", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 412022, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YC7MYcciRQwV5JULLJRT63", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 414476, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Cmy2GLiqL1nZF5DWUgrAqk", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 414776, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Cmy2GLiqL1nZF5DWUgrAqk", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_ac