.txt` and added a security note to `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` passed.\n- **Pull request:** #101 (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101). When I opened it, the reviewer list came back empty, so I requested review from alex separately. He's now listed.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}